 "stimulus_html": "In the movie <i>Black Panther,</i> the hero lives in the fictional country of Wakanda. Imagine that 111 Vibranium artifacts must be distributed among the fortress cities, or birnin, of Wakanda based on the population of each birnin. Use the population and standard quota information in the table below for the following exercises.\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>\n</th><th>Birnin Djata (D)</th>\n<th>Birnin T'Chaka (T)</th>\n<th>Birnin Zana (Z)</th>\n<th>Birnin S'Yan (S)</th>\n<th>Birnin Bashenga (B)</th>\n<th>Birnin Azzaria (A)</th>\n<th>Total</th>\n</tr>\n</thead><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Residents</td>\n<td>26,000</td>\n<td>57,000</td>\n<td>27,000</td>\n<td>18,000</td>\n<td>64,000</td>\n<td>45,000</td>\n<td>237,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Standard Quota</td>\n<td>12.18</td>\n<td>26.70</td>\n<td>12.65</td>\n<td>8.43</td>\n<td>29.98</td>\n<td>21.08</td>\n<td>111</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
